Derived from dreamdex-bot-kit
-----------------------------

The following are derived from somnia-chain/dreamdex-bot-kit
(https://github.com/somnia-chain/dreamdex-bot-kit), Copyright (c) 2026
DreamDEX S.A., used under the MIT License:

  packages/ec-core/     Kept largely unmodified — the event-contract helpers
                        wrapping @somnia-chain/markets-sdk. Individual source
                        files retain their "Copyright DreamDEX S.A." headers.

  apps/croupier/        Forked from the kit's `ec-maker` strategy, then extended
                        for Called It (fair-value control, daily-loss kill
